WEBVTT

00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.610
Ido! Ido!

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:05.510
Hang in there!

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:06.610
Hey, come on!

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:11.650
Uh. I forgot I can't scan for his
vital signs in my flesh body...

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:14.140
Ms. Karla! How is he?

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:15.490
There's still a pulse.

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:16.570
Where's Alice?

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:19.540
That Addams guy took her then they Miguel Jumped somewhere...

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:20.660
I see.

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:23.660
Anyway, Ido comes first.
His body won't last.

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.670
We have to move his mind.

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:30.050
Mr. Fa-Loser!

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:31.130
Ms. Amanza!

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.310
Kept you waiting, little lady!

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:39.010
Rick, find a healing pod!
Quickly!

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:41.640
Huh? Is this expanded space?

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:42.850
It's reality!

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:44.700
Huh? Then why is she in that form?

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:47.560
That doesn't matter!
Mr. Ido is dying right here!

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:48.840
Hurry and do something!

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:49.750
Ido?

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:53.560
His mind is in this body right now!

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:36.830
Looks like we made it somehow.

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:40.620
Retrieval of Ido's I-machine body is finished.

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:42.740
Well, let's return to the company for now.

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:43.690
Yeah.

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:47.230
If any more of the guards gather,
sorting them out will be troublesome.

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:48.440
You're right.

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:50.820
Let's get into the equipment container

00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:52.320
What about the shuttle?

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:53.280
Leave it be.

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:54.830
Maya, take the transfer mask.

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:55.780
Right!

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:08.430
Alice...

00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:19.220
So this girl is the aforementioned Orillian?

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:23.440
Strictly speaking, that's Alice inside the special Orichalt space.

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:26.490
A part of it that has materialized.

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:31.200
I had to abandon Kain's third body
to get my hands on her, though.

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:34.240
How about transferring to another
one of Kain's bodies?

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:37.640
I just can't get used to seeing
your original body.

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:39.560
No, I'm done with that.

00:03:39.560 --> 00:03:40.160
Eh?

00:03:41.810 --> 00:03:46.250
Who will be saving humanity
by using the Orillian, then?

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:50.090
It will be Addams, Mr. Hakubi Uraku.

00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:51.970
Not Kain Arisugawa.

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:57.050
The glory will belong to me,
Addams Forte Chevalier.

00:03:59.180 --> 00:04:02.980
In any case, my I-machine body was lost.

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:08.520
Well, we do have spares so it's fine, but are you alright?
It's been a while since you were flesh and blood.

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:10.360
It feels pretty weird.

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:14.370
I keep trying to enable my
expanded I-machine senses.

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:17.740
And I almost forgot what
hunger felt like, too.

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:20.040
Say, captain, how is Mr. Ido?

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:23.750
Ah, you mean how is the guy inside
Kain Arisugawa's body doing?

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:25.890
Technically, it's a clone body.

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:29.630
Maya, even after hearing it again
it just doesn't feel right!

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:32.720
He was just in his I-machine body
right before leaving!

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:35.470
So this is just crap, then.

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:38.630
Don't worry, Fa-Loser.

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:40.890
This guy won't die even if you kill him.

00:04:42.270 --> 00:04:44.340
Okay, here's the important part.

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:47.270
Is the mind that's on this
ship Kain's or Ido's?

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:48.530
It's Mr. Ido!

00:04:48.530 --> 00:04:49.280
Got it.

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:52.280
Then we'll follow through with
that bastard's plan.

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:56.910
Incoming gravity wave detected at ED-44.

00:04:56.910 --> 00:05:00.740
Planetary Federation Military's 4th dispatched
fleet confirmed to have made a Miguel Out.

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:06.740
Followed by the 3rd dispatched fleet, the 6th, and 8th
dispatched fleets have made Miguel Outs as well.

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:09.460
Message to all ships.
Keep track of the supply level...

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:12.420
How's the situation on the Orichalt collection?

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:16.190
At this point, we've collected 79%
of the planned amount.

00:05:17.430 --> 00:05:22.800
I have to say, admiral, seeing all of the federation
fleet assembled like this is magnificent.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:25.790
Heh, you should be saying that to the sponsor.

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:35.680
The problem here is whether they'll listen to us, even with Fifth decimated.

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:38.950
The Federation scurrying may have
something to do with this too, right?

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:40.160
Did something happen?

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:44.290
The Federation has started confiscating all of the Orichalt inside the Miguel Net.

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:45.290
Confiscating?

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:46.060
Yeah.

00:05:46.060 --> 00:05:48.870
From government and civilian,
indiscriminately.

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:52.800
But if they do that, the infrastructure inside the Miguel Net will collapse!

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:55.120
They must be prepared for that.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:58.340
After all, Fifth and Sixth are already gone.

00:05:58.340 --> 00:06:00.470
Trying to bait the Rajeev, then.

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:04.930
Gather everything in one
place and lure it there.

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:09.020
Because it's impossible to tell between Rajeev
and a normal planet just by looking?

00:06:09.020 --> 00:06:13.190
And then blow it away with Orichalt torpedoes somewhere far and bury it for good?

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:16.530
Where are they gathering
the collected Orichalt?

00:06:16.530 --> 00:06:17.360
Don't know.

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:19.150
That's it! I'll go find out!

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:20.380
Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:22.430
You're gonna use Orichalt transmissions?

00:06:22.430 --> 00:06:24.490
We're kind of wanted you know.

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:29.290
I don't think the military has the time
to bother with us in such a crisis.

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:31.170
And besides, we have to look for Alice!

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:32.420
That's right.

00:06:32.420 --> 00:06:35.420
If he took her away, then she must
be needed for his plan!

00:06:35.420 --> 00:06:36.800
Found it!

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:41.710
Based on the routes of the remaining Orichalt
inside the Miguel Net, the gathering point is...

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:44.430
Near the Earth!

00:06:44.430 --> 00:06:47.010
Most likely the Lagrange point L2.

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:49.980
An Orichalt storage facility is there.

00:06:49.980 --> 00:06:52.140
They're fighting near the Earth...

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:55.190
There's probably no time left.
The Federation's desperate too.

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:57.300
They should just abandon Orichalt.

00:06:57.300 --> 00:07:00.950
As if the greedy higher-ups of the Federation
would throw their treasure away.

00:07:00.950 --> 00:07:04.070
At this point there's no point mincing words.

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:08.070
The only thing we know for real
is that it's finally starting.

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:11.000
The battle with humanity's
very existence at stake.

00:07:11.890 --> 00:07:14.850
So uh, if they lose, civilization's done for?

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:15.790
Looks like it.

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:19.210
As the CEO of Escavate,
I have an announcement.

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:23.930
Until the military settles the matter with Rajeev, business is on halt.

00:07:23.930 --> 00:07:28.020
Close yourself up in expanded space and enjoy your vacation or something.

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:28.600
Over!

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:29.350
Eh?

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:30.100
Boss?

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:30.930
B-But!

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:32.390
Girlie, you're fired.

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:34.940
From this point, do whatever you want.

00:07:34.940 --> 00:07:37.800
As a special bonus, we'll even
take you to the Academy.

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:40.110
We can testify you're innocent as we-

00:07:40.110 --> 00:07:42.740
That's not it!
We still have things to do!

00:07:42.740 --> 00:07:47.030
I've already ditched all of the Orichalt
that's not needed for basic navigation.

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:48.990
We can't do anything anymore.

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:49.780
We can!

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:50.920
You're annoying!

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:54.500
Are you thinking about prattling on
with your useless ideals again?

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:55.660
We have Mr. Ido!

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:56.210
Huh?

00:07:56.210 --> 00:08:01.170
Inside his, I mean, Kain Arisugawa's memories...
there's a plan against Rajeev.

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:05.560
That Addams person I was just talking about,
he wanted that plan as well!

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:08.630
Then can't we just let that
Addams guy handle it?

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:12.490
He can be the hero of justice if he wants.

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:13.820
No way.

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:14.230
Huh?

00:08:14.440 --> 00:08:15.650
M-Mr. Ido!

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:17.180
You mustn't get out of the pod!

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:18.980
That's right, your body...

00:08:20.610 --> 00:08:28.110
It's true, Kain Arisugawa's plan against
Rajeev is in my memories.

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:32.660
But the current Addams
won't be able to do it!

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:35.370
Got it! Got it!
I got it, so get in the pod already.

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:38.920
Maya?

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:51.350
I knew you'd go here.

00:08:51.350 --> 00:08:52.770
Why are you pushing so hard?

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:55.100
Get me inside this thing.

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:56.480
I won't.

00:08:56.480 --> 00:09:00.300
If you Mind Trance in this state,
the body you finally got back...

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:02.100
It's just a clone body.

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:03.740
A false vessel.

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:05.200
But still!

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:09.910
Of course, this body did teach me
about some of my past.

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:14.290
I understood that I'm Kain Arisugawa too.

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:20.420
But more than that, I'm Ido.
I'm Ido the Excavator.

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:21.900
That's it.

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:26.920
As Ido who has the memories of Kain, I...

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:30.800
Will stop Addams and bring back Alice.

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:33.750
Maya, please.

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:35.430
There's no time.

00:09:35.770 --> 00:09:39.860
Let me be Ido.

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:51.410
<i>Is this really okay?</i>

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:58.500
<i>Mr. Ido's body will most likely not
survive another Mind Trance.</i>

00:09:59.130 --> 00:10:02.060
<i>But we could still save it. </i>

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:05.620
<i>Even if it's a clone,
we could still save his body.</i>

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:08.700
<i>But...</i>

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:10.370
Mr. Ido!

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:11.340
I...

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:15.390
Mr. Ido!

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:17.850
Yeah, that's right.

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:20.480
Hearing you calling me that...

00:10:20.480 --> 00:10:22.670
Makes me Ido.

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:33.370
His body!

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:35.100
No, that's wrong.

00:10:35.970 --> 00:10:39.670
My real body is...

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:41.630
This one.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:45.630
Oh!

00:10:45.630 --> 00:10:47.920
So you're back with us, Ido?

00:10:47.920 --> 00:10:50.260
Even though he finally got it back...

00:10:50.260 --> 00:10:51.590
What a selfish guy.

00:10:51.590 --> 00:10:55.010
I knew you were crazy,
but not to this extent.

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:57.930
Sorry, everyone, but-

00:10:57.930 --> 00:10:59.350
Don't bother saying anything.

00:10:59.810 --> 00:11:05.650
I've heard from the girlie that
you demanded our safety.

00:11:05.650 --> 00:11:08.440
Now it's our turn to pay back the favor.

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:09.390
Clair.

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:10.700
Can you make a Miguel Jump?

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:11.700
I'll try!

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:14.030
The point is L2, near the Earth.

00:11:14.030 --> 00:11:15.490
Is it really alright?

00:11:15.490 --> 00:11:19.790
For a bunch of criminals to go
to the cradle of humanity?

00:11:30.590 --> 00:11:32.550
The Rajeev groups have materialized.

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:34.910
15 minutes until they reach L2.

00:11:34.910 --> 00:11:36.030
Understood.

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:42.420
A message from the Planetary Federation
Council to all of the dispatched fleets.

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:50.530
This battle has the Federation... no,
entire mankind's existence at stake.

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:58.330
By destroying the Orichalt-consuming wandering planets,
Rajeevs, we will obtain a free universe and our future!

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:02.290
Dear soldiers, I expect great success from you!

00:12:02.290 --> 00:12:05.440
0033 until the Rajeev group
enters effective range.

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:10.000
The mass of wandering planet A18 is above the predicted values.

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:12.670
How is the situation of the exit gate fleet?

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:14.430
As planned, ma'am.

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:17.950
On standby at the outer edge of the
Schwartzschild radius of the black hole

00:12:17.950 --> 00:12:24.390
IGR-G170913624 in the Scorpio constellation.

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:28.290
Message from Fleet HQ.
Attention to the attack data of Rajeev A18.

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:32.390
Exit gate torpedoes, ready for consecutive
firing of blocks 2 and 3.

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:34.950
Rajeev group has entered the planned area.

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:36.360
Commence attack!

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:39.830
15th dispatched fleet, Orichalt
entry gate torpedoes, fire!

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:44.750
Orichalt exit gate torpedoes, fire!

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:49.130
Exit gate torpedoes, approaching
the vicinity of the black hole.

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:52.170
Orichalt to be released once
the alpha line is passed.

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:57.810
All entry gate torpedoes, Orichalt release!

00:13:02.060 --> 00:13:04.730
Rajeev A18, jump confirmed.

00:13:05.350 --> 00:13:08.850
Incoming gravity wave located
near the black hole.

00:13:11.380 --> 00:13:13.390
Rajeev A18, materialization.

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:15.260
It passed the Schwartzschild radius!

00:13:15.260 --> 00:13:16.880
Rajeev B5, materialization.

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:19.840
E7, C8, B4 confirmed as well.

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:22.650
Rajeev A18, redshift confirmed.

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:24.870
Removal from Earth space successful.

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:32.710
So at this moment the Federation fleet has used up 20% of the Orichalt torpedoes in their possession.

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:38.130
The total amount of Rajeev
mass removed is 40%.

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:40.600
So we have won, then.

00:13:41.970 --> 00:13:43.260
I wonder about that...

00:13:44.930 --> 00:13:47.750
Rajeev B12, mass rapidly changing.

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:49.400
Release entry gate torpedoes!

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:05.080
67% of the Rajeev group mass
has been removed.

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:07.250
It's going smoothly enough for now...

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:09.670
Incoming gravity wave located near D7!

00:14:09.670 --> 00:14:10.250
What?

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:13.290
It's massive! Estimated M2 class!

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:16.230
Oh, isn't this kind of bad?

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:21.640
Humanity's one thing, but you should use the Orillian just for us already!

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:24.010
But then the final battle can't be fought.

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:25.880
Who cares about that?

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:29.380
Humanity can start anew
with 200 million or so.

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:32.190
I'll let you participate as
my comrade as well.

00:14:32.190 --> 00:14:34.470
Eternal life?

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:35.430
Mhm.

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:37.570
My apologies, but I must decline.

00:14:37.570 --> 00:14:38.150
Huh?

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:44.450
To be blunt, you privileged parasites
on civilization must perish.

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:48.740
Who do you think made you
Kain's replacement?

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:51.460
The company must be
important to you as well.

00:14:51.460 --> 00:14:52.970
MT Industries?

00:14:52.970 --> 00:14:55.090
Kain's ghost isn't needed anymore.

00:14:55.320 --> 00:14:58.260
I'll make humanity recognize me myself.

00:14:58.260 --> 00:15:02.220
With this Mind Trance
I'm literally staking my life on!

00:15:06.770 --> 00:15:10.980
O Jennifer Record's daughter
turned Orillian, Alice.

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:13.930
Let us guide humanity together.

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:19.380
For the sake of a bright future, where the
demonic Kain Arisugawa doesn't exist!

00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:22.660
We are down to the last 20%
of our Orichalt torpedoes!

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:25.410
14th and 15th dispatched fleets
taking heavy damage!

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:29.910
6th to 10th dispatched fleets finished firing all of their torpedoes!

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:33.370
2nd, 5th, 18th fleets not responding!

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:36.790
If only Kain Arisugawa was here now...

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:40.050
Don't expect help from legends that might not even be real.

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:42.760
Unfortunately, humanity has lost this.

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:43.470
The rest is-

00:15:43.470 --> 00:15:46.260
Incoming gravity wave at Alpha 3!

00:15:46.260 --> 00:15:47.880
A Rajeev from the Earth's side?

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:50.570
IFF code confirmed.
It's a friendly.

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:52.230
AE Tac?

00:15:52.230 --> 00:15:54.400
Planetary construction battle system?

00:16:08.390 --> 00:16:10.300
Fret not!

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:12.400
Humanity will not perish.

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:15.510
And there won't be any more sacrifices.

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:17.020
Witness!

00:16:17.020 --> 00:16:18.750
For I am here!

00:16:18.750 --> 00:16:21.760
Addams Forte Chevalier!

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:38.560
These torpedoes are using the
relativistic jet principle?

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:41.810
The extremely high-speed
emissions from black holes...

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:46.490
Plasma digging weapons that use
high-energy plasma jets to move?

00:16:46.490 --> 00:16:49.370
So that's what MT Industries
has developed then.

00:16:52.410 --> 00:16:55.710
But they're not much more than heavy-duty digging equipment...

00:16:55.710 --> 00:16:58.130
They won't be able to do much
damage to Rajeev...

00:16:58.130 --> 00:17:01.990
Admiral Ginney, I ask that you
leave this to me.

00:17:01.990 --> 00:17:03.780
Who are you?

00:17:03.780 --> 00:17:05.660
I can't recognize your ID.

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:08.350
I'll register again once this is over.

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:10.300
That aside, I'd like to get to the point.

00:17:11.020 --> 00:17:17.390
The inside of Rajeev closely resembles a special
Orichalt space, and there's a mass of crystals there.

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:19.440
In a way, the mineral's brain.

00:17:19.440 --> 00:17:24.440
Or rather, the circuit that enables
the program to work.

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:31.220
And here is a being that possesses intelligence
inside a special Orichalt space, an Orillian.

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:35.720
Based on that data,
I created a copy of myself.

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:41.540
My clones, artificial Orillians, are being
sent towards these crystals.

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:50.390
And then the programs are changed, or sent
haywire so that the Rajeev's activity is halted!

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:54.940
That's it, Rajeevs can be given orders.

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:56.980
Such as self-destruction.

00:17:57.500 --> 00:18:07.070
Aah! Carrying humanity's countless sins, my artificial
Orillian clones are journeying towards martyrdom!

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:12.520
Now, through all of my deaths,
humanity will be saved!

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:15.540
Congratulations, mankind!

00:18:19.460 --> 00:18:24.210
Oh my, Uraku, you've Mind
Tranced into your next body?

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:26.210
There wasn't a choice, Kichou.

00:18:26.210 --> 00:18:29.300
One word from Addams
sent it into convulsions.

00:18:29.590 --> 00:18:33.180
Even though you hated moving
to other bodies so much?

00:18:33.180 --> 00:18:39.180
Well you know, you do lose 38%
of your memories every jump.

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:46.070
Biological aging also begins immediately too,
so there are no benefits other than looks.

00:18:46.280 --> 00:18:49.110
But looks like that has come
to a end as well.

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:54.000
Addams wasn't a realist,
but a romantic.

00:18:54.000 --> 00:19:00.250
Mhm. And our dream of becoming immortal
by turning into Orillians is over too.

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:02.330
Farewell.

00:19:05.920 --> 00:19:08.040
The Rajeev groups are collapsing!

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:09.800
12% left.

00:19:10.050 --> 00:19:12.260
Have we won?

00:19:12.550 --> 00:19:17.750
This strategy, unlike Orichalt torpedoes,
doesn't lose actual Orichalt!

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:19.850
Humanity's advance will not stop!

00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:21.390
Thank you, Alice!

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:23.340
It's all thanks to your data!

00:19:23.870 --> 00:19:25.400
I have won!

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:26.730
Over Kain!

00:19:26.730 --> 00:19:28.390
Glory unto me!

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:30.350
Blessings unto the people!

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:34.280
And peace unto the world!

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:10.780
It can't be...

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:12.840
You're still alive...

00:21:14.050 --> 00:21:19.020
I see, so you used Alice as an
exit gate and jumped here!

00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:20.850
As expected of you, Kain.

00:21:20.850 --> 00:21:22.080
Wrong.

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:23.960
My name is Ido.

00:21:23.960 --> 00:21:26.090
The human possessing this body.

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:29.310
So you've abandoned that clone body?

00:21:29.310 --> 00:21:32.230
How foolish, you're now just a machine.

00:21:32.230 --> 00:21:34.110
I'm the one who decided that.

00:21:34.110 --> 00:21:37.120
Hahaha! By the way, why here?

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:39.220
Couldn't you wait for your blessing?

00:21:39.220 --> 00:21:42.590
It's not long until the Rajeevs fall.

00:21:42.590 --> 00:21:46.010
They can't be destroyed.
Stop the attack.

00:21:46.010 --> 00:21:48.590
What bizarre things you say!

00:21:48.590 --> 00:21:50.110
Listen, Addams.

00:21:50.110 --> 00:21:56.420
The theory that was in Kain's memories
was missing a crucial condition.

00:21:56.420 --> 00:21:57.630
Condition?

00:21:57.630 --> 00:21:58.720
That's right.

00:21:58.720 --> 00:22:04.560
After becoming Ido and battling
Rajeev, I know it wasn't enough.

00:22:04.560 --> 00:22:09.350
Addams, the Rajeevs don't
just follow a program.

00:22:09.350 --> 00:22:12.230
They learn and evolve.

00:22:12.230 --> 00:22:13.510
Evolve?!

00:22:13.510 --> 00:22:15.360
Kain has turned retarded!

00:22:15.360 --> 00:22:17.250
Just look at this situation!

00:22:17.250 --> 00:22:19.610
The Rajeevs will soon all be gone!

00:22:19.610 --> 00:22:23.240
I told you, the current you can't do it.

00:22:23.240 --> 00:22:25.930
You're too drunk with power.

00:22:25.930 --> 00:22:29.500
When the Rajeevs are assaulted,
they learn and counterattack.

00:22:29.500 --> 00:22:31.290
W-What is this?

00:22:31.600 --> 00:22:35.550
My Orillians were supposed to
have made them go haywire!

00:22:35.740 --> 00:22:37.890
But this is...

00:22:39.010 --> 00:22:40.840
They're reviving!

00:22:40.840 --> 00:22:49.130
If we call your attack a virus, then the infected Rajeevs
quickly studies it, makes a vaccine producing antibodies.

00:22:49.130 --> 00:22:52.220
So the same attack won't work anymore.

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:54.710
To guide humanity, I...

00:22:54.710 --> 00:22:55.820
Stop the attack!

00:22:55.820 --> 00:22:59.070
Are you trying to say it's fine for
mankind to perish, you bastard?!

00:22:59.070 --> 00:23:02.360
I told you before!
Just abandon Orichalt!

00:23:02.360 --> 00:23:04.740
You don't understand the reality!

00:23:04.740 --> 00:23:07.790
You brainless scientist!

00:23:07.790 --> 00:23:08.830
Stop it!

00:23:08.830 --> 00:23:10.000
What?

00:23:17.350 --> 00:23:20.480
Stop it, please!

00:23:25.980 --> 00:23:28.190
The meaningless times have passed.

00:23:28.190 --> 00:23:30.560
We've wandered to places
we'll never return to.

00:23:30.560 --> 00:23:35.490
Now, to carve a path of our own, we must
walk the line between life and death.

00:23:35.490 --> 00:23:40.110
This is the rear stage of heaven,
till the day we must part.
